<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila hog farmers plan 25,000 T corn imports.</title>
<headline>Manila hog farmers plan 25,000 T corn imports.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group of Philippine hog farmers plan to import 25,000 tonnes of yellow corn, Manila grains traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>Two grains traders said they have received inquiries from the group on the planned imports.</p>
<p>Other details were not available.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8936</p>
</text>
